UmKL4f84kQw&oe=6AFC8BBA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "VideoThumble.png", "id": "653843270616668", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827042_653843273950001_3318244746014946578_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eze1BlnztJIQ7kNvwHfvlij&_nc_oc=AdqcTzBlf2OhaQmmjXDPgzw73KuBmHsSOBvsjlUuH1G_UeOLRhwM8S4fGtInQn6yv8o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT11qpcqQdBnrqxTpPgK-ZHp2zteuZAtPq5Kb46Ag0X_w&oe=6AFC7A5E"}, "display_name": "Break Beats", "keywords": ["song", "Beat", "music", "mr", "dance"], "long_description": "Step into *Break Beats*, where your daily life meets rhythm-fueled dance floors. This isn't just a music game\u2014it's your playlist of moods, vibes, and after-hours energy.  \nFrom the **neon-soaked Cyberpunk streets** of *Night Shift* and *Out of Office*, to the **retro charm** of *Hard Reset* and *Game On*, and finally to the **weekend-ready floors** of *Friday Vibes* and *Party Mode*\u2014every level is inspired by things we actually say and feel.  \n\nWhether you're shaking off the workday or reliving arcade glory, *Break Beats* gives you the rhythm for every kind of break.  \n**Move. Tap. Escape. Your break starts now.**\n\n", "short_description": "Break Beats throws you into the groove with everyday vibes and neon flair. Dance through city lights, pixel dreams, and weekend floor-fillers in levels named after the way we live, work, and party."}]}, "developer_name": "Biswa Games", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.biswagames.com/privacy_policy/euphoriabeats/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Biswa Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.biswagames.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1672577396871977"}, {"id":